From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:30:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] 0127: blueline test reboot: bluereboot=bootloader|recovery,
 bluereboot_after=gpu|springboard|N

Ends a hardware test boot by itself: optional sync, reboot reason in the
PM8998 PON SOFT_RB_SPARE register (reason << 1, as Linux qpnp-power-on /
qcom-pon for PM8998) and the IMEM restart_reason cookie (0x77665500 /
0x77665502, as the crosshatch msm-poweroff.c), one log line, a synchronous
write of the console ring to UFS, then PSCI SYSTEM_RESET with the UFS lock
held. blueline_keys.c gains a PON write path (apps-EE-owned channel only)
and a lock around arbiter commands. The sweetlog flush is factored into
sweet_log_write_locked() so the reboot path can call it.

---
 bsd/dev/blueline_keys.c | 120 +++++++++++++---
 bsd/dev/sweet_ufs.c     | 284 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 349 insertions(+), 55 deletions(-)

